eField>\n\n<ResponseField name=\"responses\" type=\"readonly InputResponse[] | undefined\">\n  仅回答轮(`t.respond` / `t.respondAll`)出现:逐请求的结构化回答,按 `requestId` 对位。\n</ResponseField>\n\n## `defineSandboxAgent`\n\n用于 coding agent CLI。产出的 `Agent.kind` 恒为 `\"sandbox\"`——`t.sandbox`、`t.sandbox.fileChanged()` 等文件系统断言只在这类 agent 上解锁。字段全集同样见下方「Agent 与 Adapter Context 字段」的 `SandboxAgentDef`；`ctx.sandbox`(`Sandbox` 接口)的完整方法见再下方「Sandbox 接口」。\n\n```ts\nimport { completeEvidenceCoverage, defineSandboxAgent } from \"niceeval/adapter\";\nimport { command } from \"niceeval/sandbox\";\n\nexport default defineSandboxAgent({\n  name: \"my-cli-agent\",\n  evidenceCoverage: completeEvidenceCoverage,\n  ensure: {\n    identity: { agent: \"my-cli-agent\", version: \"1.0.0\" },\n    probe: command(\"my-agent\", [\"--version\"]),\n  },\n  async send(input, ctx) {\n    await ctx.sandbox.runCommand(\"my-agent\", [\"run\", input.text]);\n    return { status: \"completed\", events: [] };\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## 注册\n\n```ts\nimport { defineExperiment } from \"niceeval\";\nimport echo from \"./agents/echo\";\n\nexport default defineExperiment({\n  agent: echo,\n  attempts: 1,\n});\n```\n\n## Agent 与 Adapter Context 字段\n\n`defineDirectAgent`（`DirectAgentDef`）、`defineSandboxAgent`（`SandboxAgentDef`）的构造参数，\n以及两者的 `send(input, ctx)` 都会拿到的 `ctx`（`AgentContext`）：\n\n{/* GENERATED:BEGIN agent-def */}\n\n{/* 本区块由 pnpm docs:reference 从源码注释生成,勿手改;要改文案,改对应源码的 TSDoc/JSDoc(映射见 scripts/generate-reference.ts) */}\n\n### `DirectAgentDef`\n\n#### `name`\n\n```ts\nname: string;\n```\n\nagent 的显示名/标识,原样进入 `Agent.name`——不是注册表查找 key,只用于展示、结果归属与去重指纹。\n\n#### `evidenceCoverage`\n\n```ts\nevidenceCoverage: EvidenceCoverage;\n```\n\n该 Adapter 的常态证据覆盖声明；完整采集可用 `completeEvidenceCoverage`。\n\n#### `setup`\n\n```ts\nsetup?: DirectAgentSetup;\n```\n\n每个 attempt 一次。Direct Agent 不接收 Sandbox；常用于建立连接、鉴权等一次性准备。\n\n#### `tracing`\n\n```ts\ntracing?: Omit<AgentTracing, \"configure\">;\n```\n\nOTLP 导出配置:被测对象怎么把 trace 发到 endpoint(env-based 注入)。\n\n#### `spanMapper`\n\n```ts\nspanMapper?: SpanMapper;\n```\n\n原生 span → canonical 的薄 mapper;省略走通用 heuristic。只影响瀑布图。\n\n#### `send`\n\n```ts\nsend(input: TurnInput, ctx: AgentContext): Promise<Turn>;\n```\n\n每轮一次:把一轮 prompt 直接发给函数、SDK 或服务端点,解析响应成 events。\n\n#### `classifySendFailure`\n\n```ts\nclassifySendFailure?: SendFailureClassifier;\n```\n\n可选 send 执行失败分类器:见 `Agent.classifySendFailure`。\n\n#### `teardown`\n\n```ts\nteardown?: DirectAgentTeardown;\n```\n\n运行结束前的清理,当且仅当本 attempt 走到过 `setup` 时点才执行(`setup` 抛错不豁免),\n在 finally 里跑一次。\n\n### `SandboxAgentDef`\n\n#### `name`\n\n```ts\nname: string;\n```\n\nagent 的显示名/标识,原样进入 `Agent.name`——不是注册表查找 key,只用于展示、结果归属与去重指纹。\n\n#### `evidenceCoverage`\n\n```ts\nevidenceCoverage: EvidenceCoverage;\n```\n\n该 Adapter 的常态证据覆盖声明；完整采集可用 `completeEvidenceCoverage`。\n\n#### `ensure`\n\n```ts\nensure: AgentEnsure | readonly AgentEnsure[];\n```\n\n单条或数组都按声明顺序规范化为 Agent layer。\n\n#### `installers`\n\n```ts\ninstallers?: readonly AgentInstaller[];\n```\n\n配对安装层；省略表示这个 adapter 只提供 probe 协议，未命中时 Runner 在\n`agent.ensure` 点名缺失的精确 identity。工厂会把省略规范化成空数组。\n\n#### `setup`\n\n```ts\nsetup?: AgentSetup;\n```\n\n每条 Attempt 一次(不是每轮 send 一次):写 config.toml / 鉴权配置(model/base/auth 等\n本 Attempt 内不变的运行配置)。CLI 的 probe、安装与复检属于 `agent.ensure`。运行器在 Sandbox\n备好(layer prepare/ensure/baseline 之后)、第一次 send 前调用一次,不返回值。\n\n#### `tracing`\n\n```ts\ntracing?: AgentTracing;\n```\n\nOTLP 导出配置:Sandbox 里怎么让 CLI 把 trace 发到 endpoint(env / 配置文件),从 setup 拆出。\n\n#### `spanMapper`\n\n```ts\nspanMapper?: SpanMapper;\n```\n\n原生 span → canonical 的薄 mapper;省略走通用 heuristic。只影响瀑布图。\n\n#### `send`\n\n```ts\nsend(input: TurnInput, ctx: SandboxAgentContext): Promise<Turn>;\n```\n\n每轮一次:跑 prompt(fresh / resume)+ 解析成 events。\n\n#### `classifySendFailure`\n\n```ts\nclassifySendFailure?: SendFailureClassifier;\n```\n\n可选 send 执行失败分类器:见 `Agent.classifySendFailure`。\n\n#### `teardown`\n\n```ts\nteardown?: AgentTeardown;\n```\n\nSandbox 销毁前的清理,当且仅当本 attempt 走到过 `setup` 时点才执行(`setup` 抛错不豁免),\n在 finally 里跑一次。\n\n### `AgentContext`\n\n#### `signal`\n\n```ts\nreadonly signal: AbortSignal;\n```\n\n软取消信号:合并了 attempt 超时、run 级中断(用户 Ctrl+C)与评估用例自身的中断请求\n(见 src/runner/attempt.ts)。adapter 可以选择性检查它(或直接传给 `fetch`)以提前\n优雅退出,但这不是唯一的硬边界——即便 adapter 完全忽略它,运行器也会用\n`Effect.timeoutTo` 兜底强制收尾(停 Sandbox 容器)。\n\n---\ntitle: \"niceeval/expect matchers 与自定义断言参考\"\nsidebarTitle: \"断言 Matchers\"\ndescription: \"niceeval/expect 参考：includes、equals、matches、similarity、satisfies，以及形状断言 includesUrl、hasSections。可链式调用 .gate() 或 .atLeast(0.7)，也可以用 makeAssertion 构建自定义 matcher。\"\n---\n\n`niceeval/expect` 提供一组可组合 matcher，传给 `t.check()` 或 `t.require()`。matcher 会返回一个 `Assertion`，并带有默认严重性：`gate` 或 `soft`。\n\n```ts\nimport { includes, equals, matches, similarity, satisfies } from \"niceeval/expect\";\n```\n\n## 使用方式\n\n```ts\nt.check(t.reply, includes(\"confirmed\"));\nt.check(turn.data, equals({ intent: \"refund\" }));\nt.require(turn.status, equals(\"completed\"));\n```\n\n| 方法 | 失败时 | 适合 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `t.check` | 记录结果，继续执行 | 大多数断言 |\n| `t.require` | 立即抛出，中断 test | 后续执行没有意义的前置条件 |\n\n## Matchers\n\n下面每个 matcher 的签名和说明从 `niceeval/expect` 的源码生成，和当前实现保持同步。","exit_code":0}},"command":{"kind":"command","original":{"state":"opaque","reason":"unsupported-protocol"},"logical":{"state":"opaque","normalizer":"logical-command/v1","reason":"original-opaque","originalReason":"unsupported-protocol"}},"start":{"turnOrdinal":2,"eventOrdinal":15},"lifecycle":{"state":"available","status":"completed","finish":{"turnOrdinal":2,"eventOrdinal":16}}},{"id":"[\"niceeval.logical-tool-occurrence/1\",\"session-1\",\"turn-2\",2,17]","session":"session-1","turn":"turn-2","name":{"original":"command_execution","canonical":"shell"},"input":{"state":"complete","value":{"command":"/bin/bash -lc \"find gpt_researcher -type f -name '*.py' -print0 | xargs -0 grep -nE 'REPORT_SOURCE|report_source.*(web|local)|\\\"local\\\"' | sed -n '1,260p'\nsed -n '1,240p' .env.example\nfind tests -type f -maxdepth 2 -print0 | xargs